<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Seitel cut by Salomon.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Seitel cut by Salomon.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it downgraded Seitel Inc to hold from buy on price.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost one to 36.</p>
</text>
